sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Клиент (Frontend)
    participant Backend as Backend Server
    participant RabbitMQ as RabbitMQ
    participant API as chat_api_service

    %% Установка SSE соединения
    Client->>Backend: GET /chat/conversation/{id}/stream
    Backend->>RabbitMQ: Subscribe to queue (conversation_id)
    RabbitMQ-->>Backend: Connection established
    Backend-->>Client: SSE connection opened (200 OK)

    %% Отправка сообщения пользователем
    Client->>Backend: POST /chat/conversation/{id}/query
    Backend->>API: Сохранить сообщение пользователя
    API-->>Backend: message_id
    Backend-->>Client: message_id


    API->>API: Process message
    API->>RabbitMQ: Publish event (message_id, answer_id, conversation_id, user_id)
    RabbitMQ-->>Backend: Event received

    Backend->>API: GET /chat/message/{message_id}
    API-->>Backend: Message data

    %% Завершение генерации
    API->>API: Update message status (status: delivered)
    API->>RabbitMQ: Publish event (message_id, status: done)
    RabbitMQ-->>Backend: Event received

    Backend->>API: GET /chat/message/{message_id}
    API-->>Backend: Full message with content
    Backend-->>Client: SSE event

    Note over Client: Отображаем ответ ассистента
